        "readable_text": "Prompt:\nFactor the expression [MATH: 3x^{3} + 2x^{2} \u2212 x.]\n\nChoices:\na. [MATH: x(3x \u2212 1)^{2}]\nb. [MATH: x(3x + 1)(x \u2212 1)]\nc. [MATH: (3x \u2212 1)^{2}(x + 1)]\nd. [MATH: (3x \u2212 1)(x + 1)^{2}]\ne. [MATH: x(3x \u2212 1)(x + 1)]"
